  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thailand Prosperity and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral engagement to support Thailand&apos;s prosperity and resilience through a portfolio of small, exploratory activities in educational quality, economic reform and electoral processes. In light of Thailand&apos;s status as an Advanced Middle Income Country, activities seek to address issues which make Thailand vulnerable to an economic slow-down and which may impede progress towards high-income status. The estimated total value of this investment is up to $2 million in the 2018-19 financial year.</narrative>
  </description>
